        "id": 133737,
        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-25T14:35:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MrLeRobot\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/48/1932_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MrLeRobot:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><strong>Christopher wrote:</strong><br><blockquote>Glad to hear that you like both GTG and DHMG!</blockquote></div>\nFor 2015, I took the resolution to not buy any more games, with the exception of SotM expansions and DHMG releases. I was utterly pleased when DHMG announced they've formed a partnership with you guys. My 2 favorites publishers working together is just plain awesome...! :)\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm in the same boat. Historically, I've had two auto-backs on Kickstarter. Greater Than Games and Dice Hate Me Games. When I was hired by Greater Than Games, that slashed my gaming expenses like crazy since now I just have access to GtG stuff.</p>",
