        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"jffdougan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/48/1882_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jffdougan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Di d you ever look at anything from the Evil Hat crew? If I had enough disposable income to regularly back Kickstarter projects, they'd be up there.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ha. The current project that Evil Hat has running is the first of their I haven't backed. I never really cared for Don't Rest Your Head, so I don't have much of an attachment to another game based on it. But I have Zeppelin Attack and lots of Fate stuff in my collection.</p>",
